<p><a href="https://www.uefa.com/uefayouthleague/clubs/players/250224996--ismael-camara/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UEFA</a>, <a href="https://www.arsenal.com/news/u19s-report-arsenal-2-3-losc-lille-aml3J4v7nyUK" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Arsenal.com</a>, <a href="https://madeinfoot.ouest-france.fr/infos/article-youth-league-le-losc-u19-s-impose-sans-trembler-face-au-galatasaray-sk-u19-et-poursuit-son-beau-parcours-resume-543043.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Made in Foot</a>, <a href="https://africafoot.com/traore-camara-et-kebe-un-trio-malien-des-jeunes-du-losc-qui-attire-lattention/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Africafoot</a>, <a href="https://lepetitlillois.com/2026/01/06/mercato-le-losc-recrute-un-jeune-du-paris-fc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Le Petit Lillois</a>, <a href="https://news.maxifoot.fr/ldc-u19/bodo/glimt-fait-chuter-lille-foot-466985.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Maxifoot</a>, <a href="https://www.goal.com/en/lists/nxgn-2026-best-teenage-wonderkids-football/blt2f8486395140dacd" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GOAL (NXGN 2026)</a>, <a href="https://www.uefa.com/uefayouthleague/statistics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">UEFA (statistiques Youth League)</a>.</p>
<p>— Passe D</p>', 'article', 'published',
